Package: shunt-xray
Version: @COREVER@
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: Boris Kaganovich <bkaganovich@gmail.com>
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Description: xray-core binary for Shunt
 The upstream xray-core proxy binary, installed at /opt/shunt/bin/xray where
 Shunt expects it. Packaged separately so that the core can be updated
 independently of the application.
